(5667055, 823468, 30982, '<td valign="top">My kinda respose to the challenge.  :-)  Perhaps a wee bit of white balance adjustment, or convert to B&amp;W, as the yellowish tinge may be a bit offputting.  I like the partial peeps on the right.  It seems as though they may be considering the suggestion.</td>', 'My kinda respose to the challenge.  :-)  Perhaps a wee bit of white balance adjustment, or convert to B&W, as the yellowish tinge may be a bit offputting.  I like the partial peeps on the right.  It seems as though they may be considering the suggestion.', '2009-09-30 07:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5667056, 824594, 110294, '<td valign="top">Fun Comp and DOF</td>', 'Fun Comp and DOF', '2009-09-30 07:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5667057, 824611, 110294, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. I like the comp and the colors.</td>', 'Very nicely done. I like the comp and the colors.', '2009-09-30 07:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5667109, 823731, 29513, '<td valign="top">Nice eye.  I''m always complaining about power lines in the way of some shot I want.  I didn''t even think of them when they might be the subject.</td>', 'Nice eye.  I''m always complaining about power lines in the way of some shot I want.  I didn''t even think of them when they might be the subject.', '2009-09-30 08:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5667126, 823896, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love the light here.  The building beyond is just a tad jarring, but then you realize that adds even more to the solitude here under the bridge.</td>', 'I love the light here.  The building beyond is just a tad jarring, but then you realize that adds even more to the solitude here under the bridge.', '2009-09-30 08:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5667128, 824656, 30982, '<td valign="top">From the angle, it appears the tree trimming guys need to trim this one a bit - it''s eating the lines!</td>', 'From the angle, it appears the tree trimming guys need to trim this one a bit - it''s eating the lines!', '2009-09-30 08:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5667130, 824593, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not normally an appealing subject, but I really like the way you''ve approached this - definitely made it appealing with your choice of composition, and the minimalistic color scheme.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Not normally an appealing subject, but I really like the way you''ve approached this - definitely made it appealing with your choice of composition, and the minimalistic color scheme.  Nicely done.', '2009-09-30 08:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5667131, 823327, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of light and shadow.  Love the person silhouetted foreground, too.</td>', 'Excellent use of light and shadow.  Love the person silhouetted foreground, too.', '2009-09-30 08:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5667133, 824663, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject - nice collection of lines.  May have wanted to compose/crop just enough to get rid of the line on the rightmost corner, but really not a biggie since outside of the challenge it can be cloned.</td>', 'Good choice of subject - nice collection of lines.  May have wanted to compose/crop just enough to get rid of the line on the rightmost corner, but really not a biggie since outside of the challenge it can be cloned.', '2009-09-30 08:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
