(5667141, 824708, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yes, as in straight up alcohol, but maybe not so much as in "Capture an image that includes only straight lines." but then it depends on if voters read the details fo the challenge.  The murky lighting on this lends to the inebriatedness of a straight beverage, but may also lead viewers to click on a lower score.</td>', 'Yes, as in straight up alcohol, but maybe not so much as in "Capture an image that includes only straight lines." but then it depends on if voters read the details fo the challenge.  The murky lighting on this lends to the inebriatedness of a straight beverage, but may also lead viewers to click on a lower score.', '2009-09-30 08:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5667143, 824302, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cool.  Like the goldenness of it and the sorta captured light in the bulb.</td>', 'Cool.  Like the goldenness of it and the sorta captured light in the bulb.', '2009-09-30 08:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5667144, 824464, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yep, good straight lines, nicely symmetric.  Kinda dull as a picture, though.</td>', 'Yep, good straight lines, nicely symmetric.  Kinda dull as a picture, though.', '2009-09-30 08:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
