(5667831, 824611, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of lines AND a sunset.  And I like the powerlines.  I''m in favor of them in pictures sometimes - they work here very nicely.</td>', 'Very nice use of lines AND a sunset.  And I like the powerlines.  I''m in favor of them in pictures sometimes - they work here very nicely.', '2009-09-30 16:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
