(5667833, 824625, 30982, '<td valign="top">Probably a bit too dark for most to see well.  If I wait a bit, and let my eyes adjust, it''s visible, but barely.</td>', 'Probably a bit too dark for most to see well.  If I wait a bit, and let my eyes adjust, it''s visible, but barely.', '2009-09-30 16:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5667836, 823735, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think there''s a song or a group with that name.  Can''t remember which.  As for the shot, I like it.  I like the haze of the city against the relative clarity of the pier.  Not sure the folks voting for "straight" will buy it, but it is predominantly made up of things that have straight lines.</td>', 'I think there''s a song or a group with that name.  Can''t remember which.  As for the shot, I like it.  I like the haze of the city against the relative clarity of the pier.  Not sure the folks voting for "straight" will buy it, but it is predominantly made up of things that have straight lines.', '2009-09-30 16:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5667838, 824689, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice quiet sort of picture.  I''d say that forward pier blocks my view a bit, but it really doesn''t.  It in a way invites me to look around it.</td>', 'Nice quiet sort of picture.  I''d say that forward pier blocks my view a bit, but it really doesn''t.  It in a way invites me to look around it.', '2009-09-30 16:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5667840, 824638, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of shallow DOF.  And I like that though the lines are straight (or supposed to be) they have a squiggly character, as though they haven''t had their coffee yet.</td>', 'Wonderful use of shallow DOF.  And I like that though the lines are straight (or supposed to be) they have a squiggly character, as though they haven''t had their coffee yet.', '2009-09-30 16:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5667841, 823783, 30982, '<td valign="top">While you do have some excellent straight lines here, the curved lines of the arches are the dominate feature to me.</td>', 'While you do have some excellent straight lines here, the curved lines of the arches are the dominate feature to me.', '2009-09-30 16:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5667845, 824449, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good angle to show off the lines of the train, but perhaps just a hair dark on this side whch makes the lead car look a little black-blob-ish.  A bit more light would bring out the detail of the side rails on that car - either a different time of day or perhaps a flash?  Still a good take on the challenge.</td>', 'Good angle to show off the lines of the train, but perhaps just a hair dark on this side whch makes the lead car look a little black-blob-ish.  A bit more light would bring out the detail of the side rails on that car - either a different time of day or perhaps a flash?  Still a good take on the challenge.', '2009-09-30 16:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5667846, 824224, 30982, '<td valign="top">Parking lot, or series of concrete boxes?  Cool.</td>', 'Parking lot, or series of concrete boxes?  Cool.', '2009-09-30 16:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5667857, 824664, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very cool - I like the way it moves from concrete (literally) to nearly transparent, almost sketched in nature.  Very nice interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'Very cool - I like the way it moves from concrete (literally) to nearly transparent, almost sketched in nature.  Very nice interpretation of the challenge.', '2009-09-30 16:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5667858, 823534, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent mood created here.  Either one of confinement as your title implies, or one of contemplation.</td>', 'Excellent mood created here.  Either one of confinement as your title implies, or one of contemplation.', '2009-09-30 16:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5667860, 824482, 30982, '<td valign="top">Plain, basic, and for some reason I really like it.  Works well in B&amp;W and the angled bit on the right provides a nice counterbalance.</td>', 'Plain, basic, and for some reason I really like it.  Works well in B&W and the angled bit on the right provides a nice counterbalance.', '2009-09-30 16:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5667862, 823882, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOVELY light here.  Very nice balance of the arches, and quite love the way the faces on the left are dark, on the right are lit.  Excellent response to the challenge.</td>', 'LOVELY light here.  Very nice balance of the arches, and quite love the way the faces on the left are dark, on the right are lit.  Excellent response to the challenge.', '2009-09-30 16:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5667863, 824257, 30982, '<td valign="top">Fine response to this challenge.  The lines are straight enough for me, but more importantly, you found an interesting subject in interesting light - not just something with straight lines.</td>', 'Fine response to this challenge.  The lines are straight enough for me, but more importantly, you found an interesting subject in interesting light - not just something with straight lines.', '2009-09-30 16:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5667865, 824612, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nifty abstract - no sense of the size of this at all, which adds to the intrigue.</td>', 'Very nifty abstract - no sense of the size of this at all, which adds to the intrigue.', '2009-09-30 16:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5667867, 823874, 30982, '<td valign="top">The boards have pretty straight edges, but the overall picture lacks general interest for me.</td>', 'The boards have pretty straight edges, but the overall picture lacks general interest for me.', '2009-09-30 17:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5667869, 824510, 30982, '<td valign="top">The lines from the roadway are "straight" but the overall subject of the photograph really doesn''t lend itself to "straight".  Red, speed, precision, motion, even graceful - but not really "straight".</td>', 'The lines from the roadway are "straight" but the overall subject of the photograph really doesn''t lend itself to "straight".  Red, speed, precision, motion, even graceful - but not really "straight".', '2009-09-30 17:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5667870, 823785, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh - I get the impression from your title that you want this to fit the challenge...  OK.  The horizon is a straight line.</td>', 'Heh - I get the impression from your title that you want this to fit the challenge...  OK.  The horizon is a straight line.', '2009-09-30 17:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5667871, 824442, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yep, that''s a straight edge!  But as a standalone photograph, it''s not particularly interesting.  If you wanted to use this for stock, you''ll need to have your ruler even sharper than you have it here (though it''s not too bad) and you should probably include both corners.</td>', 'Yep, that''s a straight edge!  But as a standalone photograph, it''s not particularly interesting.  If you wanted to use this for stock, you''ll need to have your ruler even sharper than you have it here (though it''s not too bad) and you should probably include both corners.', '2009-09-30 17:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
