(5669099, 824228, 30982, '<td valign="top">Comment per request after voting:  Good on the challenge fulfillment - straight lines and kept it to that, which really was quite challenging, if you ask me.  I was a bit intrigued by the colors - what be they for?  But seeing as how they weren''t in the shape of bodies, I figured them to be random or street construction indicators, and I moved on.  Not sure what I''d recommend as far as increasing the "hold me here" factor, since I don''t know the rest of the scene, but that''s what you''d need on this one - something to keep the viewer here just a bit longer.</td>', 'Comment per request after voting:  Good on the challenge fulfillment - straight lines and kept it to that, which really was quite challenging, if you ask me.  I was a bit intrigued by the colors - what be they for?  But seeing as how they weren''t in the shape of bodies, I figured them to be random or street construction indicators, and I moved on.  Not sure what I''d recommend as far as increasing the "hold me here" factor, since I don''t know the rest of the scene, but that''s what you''d need on this one - something to keep the viewer here just a bit longer.', '2009-10-01 10:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669199, 823882, 83544, '<td valign="top">great photo, the b&amp;w really works here...btw I love that song from RHCP</td>', 'great photo, the b&w really works here...btw I love that song from RHCP', '2009-10-01 10:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
