(5676784, 823398, 31917, '<td valign="top">Nice. i like the color adjustments.  usually not a fan of straight on or centered shots, but this works nicely.</td>', 'Nice. i like the color adjustments.  usually not a fan of straight on or centered shots, but this works nicely.', '2009-10-06 12:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
