(5677164, 824613, 17279, '<td valign="top">Nice pattern and interesting bridge.  For some reason, all the girders seem to be a bit out of focus to me.</td>', 'Nice pattern and interesting bridge.  For some reason, all the girders seem to be a bit out of focus to me.', '2009-10-06 18:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677165, 824611, 17279, '<td valign="top">I like this idea a lot... I think it might be more effective to have the horizon sit on the upper third line rather than the center.  Maybe a little more detail on the dark portion of the image (although I am not quite sure of that... it may be better without detail).</td>', 'I like this idea a lot... I think it might be more effective to have the horizon sit on the upper third line rather than the center.  Maybe a little more detail on the dark portion of the image (although I am not quite sure of that... it may be better without detail).', '2009-10-06 18:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677166, 824331, 17279, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, great lines.  Seem a bit too bright overall though it could be my monitor I suppose.  I might have tried a landscape orientation on this to emphasize the lines and lose some of the upper portion of the buildings.</td>', 'Nice shot, great lines.  Seem a bit too bright overall though it could be my monitor I suppose.  I might have tried a landscape orientation on this to emphasize the lines and lose some of the upper portion of the buildings.', '2009-10-06 18:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677168, 824445, 17279, '<td valign="top">Nice image... good abstract of a simple subject.  The water drops add quite a bit.  Bumping up.</td>', 'Nice image... good abstract of a simple subject.  The water drops add quite a bit.  Bumping up.', '2009-10-06 18:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677169, 824608, 17279, '<td valign="top">Nice image overall with good lines and nice color.  I''m not sure if I would have liked this more without the sky (a tighter crop on the building itself).</td>', 'Nice image overall with good lines and nice color.  I''m not sure if I would have liked this more without the sky (a tighter crop on the building itself).', '2009-10-06 18:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677170, 824620, 17279, '<td valign="top">Good idea and concept.  The layout you have chosen doesn''t quite sit well with me, but that''s just me.  Since you are using a ruler in your image, it might all tie together better if you used a pencil or some other drafting type instrument rather than the marker (perhaps even just a thinner marker).</td>', 'Good idea and concept.  The layout you have chosen doesn''t quite sit well with me, but that''s just me.  Since you are using a ruler in your image, it might all tie together better if you used a pencil or some other drafting type instrument rather than the marker (perhaps even just a thinner marker).', '2009-10-06 18:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677172, 824411, 17279, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and good take on the challenge.  The colors seem a bit much to me though... perhaps toning it down a litte?</td>', 'Nice shot and good take on the challenge.  The colors seem a bit much to me though... perhaps toning it down a litte?', '2009-10-06 18:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677174, 824510, 17279, '<td valign="top">Really a nice sports capture!  Not too sure how well it conveys the challenge topic though, especially since he appears to be in a turn.</td>', 'Really a nice sports capture!  Not too sure how well it conveys the challenge topic though, especially since he appears to be in a turn.', '2009-10-06 18:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677176, 824588, 17279, '<td valign="top">Really well done.  Love the black and white treatment and the shadows are great.  At first I thought it was a filing cabinet and it made me think of those old B&amp;W private eye movies/shows.  Learning it was a dryer kind of spoiled the mood (not affecting the score though).</td>', 'Really well done.  Love the black and white treatment and the shadows are great.  At first I thought it was a filing cabinet and it made me think of those old B&W private eye movies/shows.  Learning it was a dryer kind of spoiled the mood (not affecting the score though).', '2009-10-06 18:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677177, 823757, 17279, '<td valign="top">I like the color you captured on this.  The branch is a bit distracting as it takes away from the uniformity of the patterns and lines.  Nice image otherwise.</td>', 'I like the color you captured on this.  The branch is a bit distracting as it takes away from the uniformity of the patterns and lines.  Nice image otherwise.', '2009-10-06 18:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677178, 824574, 17279, '<td valign="top">Nice lines in this.  The huge I-beams almost make this look like a triptych rather than a single image.</td>', 'Nice lines in this.  The huge I-beams almost make this look like a triptych rather than a single image.', '2009-10-06 18:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677180, 824316, 17279, '<td valign="top">I like this idea and the colors are great.  I can''t tell what the reflection includes (sky and clouds?) but I think this might look better with a more uniform reflection.</td>', 'I like this idea and the colors are great.  I can''t tell what the reflection includes (sky and clouds?) but I think this might look better with a more uniform reflection.', '2009-10-06 18:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677181, 824615, 17279, '<td valign="top">Nice image and idea.  The colors are a bit hard on my eyes (hot pink on black).  Also I think a close macro on these tubes would have emphasized the lines more.</td>', 'Nice image and idea.  The colors are a bit hard on my eyes (hot pink on black).  Also I think a close macro on these tubes would have emphasized the lines more.', '2009-10-06 18:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677182, 824224, 17279, '<td valign="top">Intresting take on the challenge.  Almost seems like it should be one of those optical illusions.</td>', 'Intresting take on the challenge.  Almost seems like it should be one of those optical illusions.', '2009-10-06 18:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677184, 824093, 17279, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Black and white works well.  I don''t know if I would have included the uppermost portion of the image.  I think I would have liked to see the lines running toward (and off) the edge of the image.</td>', 'Nicely done.  Black and white works well.  I don''t know if I would have included the uppermost portion of the image.  I think I would have liked to see the lines running toward (and off) the edge of the image.', '2009-10-06 18:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677188, 823783, 17279, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that you used arches to convey the theme of "straight"  I would have liked to see this cropped tighter to exclude the first arch and the distracting elements (graffiti) in the foreground.</td>', 'I like the fact that you used arches to convey the theme of "straight"  I would have liked to see this cropped tighter to exclude the first arch and the distracting elements (graffiti) in the foreground.', '2009-10-06 18:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677189, 824499, 17279, '<td valign="top">Colorful yet moody. I like it.</td>', 'Colorful yet moody. I like it.', '2009-10-06 18:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677191, 823731, 17279, '<td valign="top">I like the framing/composition you chose here.  I am not sure I like having the clouds in the image, as I think they take something away.  I know you have no control over that though... just saying.</td>', 'I like the framing/composition you chose here.  I am not sure I like having the clouds in the image, as I think they take something away.  I know you have no control over that though... just saying.', '2009-10-06 18:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677193, 824628, 17279, '<td valign="top">Wow, great color on this night shot.  A bit blown out on some of the highlights I think.  Toning down those highlights would really boost this image.</td>', 'Wow, great color on this night shot.  A bit blown out on some of the highlights I think.  Toning down those highlights would really boost this image.', '2009-10-06 19:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677194, 824509, 17279, '<td valign="top">Great use of the lighting to enhance the lines on this.</td>', 'Great use of the lighting to enhance the lines on this.', '2009-10-06 19:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677196, 824601, 17279, '<td valign="top">Wow, great colors... almost like a commercial/product shot.  Good use of DOF as well.  I do think the multiple layered reflections distract on this however.</td>', 'Wow, great colors... almost like a commercial/product shot.  Good use of DOF as well.  I do think the multiple layered reflections distract on this however.', '2009-10-06 19:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677197, 824704, 17279, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and patterns and I like the almost monotone feel you presented here.  However, turning the image upside down detracts from this in my opinon, although others may feel differently.</td>', 'Nice lines and patterns and I like the almost monotone feel you presented here.  However, turning the image upside down detracts from this in my opinon, although others may feel differently.', '2009-10-06 19:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677198, 824464, 17279, '<td valign="top">Simple, clean and good colors.  Great work with such a plain and simple subject.</td>', 'Simple, clean and good colors.  Great work with such a plain and simple subject.', '2009-10-06 19:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677199, 823398, 17279, '<td valign="top">Nice... simple, clean and effective.  Too bad you couldn''t get rid of the power lines on the right.</td>', 'Nice... simple, clean and effective.  Too bad you couldn''t get rid of the power lines on the right.', '2009-10-06 19:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677200, 824612, 17279, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and patterns on this.  The reflection on the upper center detracts a bit, but otherwise really nice.</td>', 'I like the colors and patterns on this.  The reflection on the upper center detracts a bit, but otherwise really nice.', '2009-10-06 19:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677202, 824714, 17279, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge.  I''m not sure if I like the lines being level though...  It seems to make the image somewhat boring to me.  Adding some tilt might make this more dynamic.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge.  I''m not sure if I like the lines being level though...  It seems to make the image somewhat boring to me.  Adding some tilt might make this more dynamic.', '2009-10-06 19:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677205, 824582, 17279, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  I think the area around the pier is a bit dark while the bridge in the background is fairly light and it all ends up drawing my eyes right to the background.</td>', 'Nice image.  I think the area around the pier is a bit dark while the bridge in the background is fairly light and it all ends up drawing my eyes right to the background.', '2009-10-06 19:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677208, 824638, 17279, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge.  The problem is that you chose lines that aren''t straight... I think that would have made all the difference in this photo.  Good use of DOF though.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge.  The problem is that you chose lines that aren''t straight... I think that would have made all the difference in this photo.  Good use of DOF though.', '2009-10-06 19:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677210, 823288, 17279, '<td valign="top">While there are straight lines in the web, I don''t really feel that it effectively conveys the challenge theme.  Still, a very cool spider shot.</td>', 'While there are straight lines in the web, I don''t really feel that it effectively conveys the challenge theme.  Still, a very cool spider shot.', '2009-10-06 19:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677211, 824575, 17279, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s my monitor, but the colors seem way to saturated here.  I think the subject is an interesting one, but I think it might be differently composed to make it more compelling.</td>', 'Maybe it''s my monitor, but the colors seem way to saturated here.  I think the subject is an interesting one, but I think it might be differently composed to make it more compelling.', '2009-10-06 19:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677214, 824661, 17279, '<td valign="top">Nice image, good framing and composition.  Ncely shot.  Would this look better with a slight sepia tint?</td>', 'Nice image, good framing and composition.  Ncely shot.  Would this look better with a slight sepia tint?', '2009-10-06 19:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677216, 824079, 17279, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and great colors.  I also like the chrome and the reflections.  I think you included too many distracting elements around the outside areas though.  Good shot overall.</td>', 'Nice lines and great colors.  I also like the chrome and the reflections.  I think you included too many distracting elements around the outside areas though.  Good shot overall.', '2009-10-06 19:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677217, 823534, 17279, '<td valign="top">Wow... this is so simple yet so moody... I really like it.  I''m not sure if I like the color cast or whether black and white might work better.  Still a well conceived and executed image.</td>', 'Wow... this is so simple yet so moody... I really like it.  I''m not sure if I like the color cast or whether black and white might work better.  Still a well conceived and executed image.', '2009-10-06 19:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677220, 824415, 17279, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and lines.  This is a very pleasing image and think it would look great on a wall.  I''m not sure it really fits the straight challenge so much as it might fit a challenge suited to other shapes.</td>', 'Nice colors and lines.  This is a very pleasing image and think it would look great on a wall.  I''m not sure it really fits the straight challenge so much as it might fit a challenge suited to other shapes.', '2009-10-06 19:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677224, 824368, 17279, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and I like how you executed on this.  I''m not sure whether "mostly straight" is still "straight" :)  The line of leaves (which I assume is the "straight" portion of the image) is not immediately noticeable so I think you will lose points from many on this.</td>', 'Nice colors and I like how you executed on this.  I''m not sure whether "mostly straight" is still "straight" :)  The line of leaves (which I assume is the "straight" portion of the image) is not immediately noticeable so I think you will lose points from many on this.', '2009-10-06 19:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677225, 823349, 92577, '<td valign="top">striking</td>', 'striking', '2009-10-06 19:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5677556, 824566, 67145, '<td valign="top">OMG .. i wondered if you''d be featured in the first three when i updated to see the new challenges and the winners of the previous .. congrats alan .. brilliant shot .. :)</td>', 'OMG .. i wondered if you''d be featured in the first three when i updated to see the new challenges and the winners of the previous .. congrats alan .. brilliant shot .. :)', '2009-10-07 01:04:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677565, 824566, 100393, '<td valign="top">Told you!!<br/> <br/>I really do expect to see your 5D mkII on eBay!!!<br/> <br/>Keep this up and ''D'' in DP Challenge will stand for Dougi555.<br/> <br/>Well done Alan.</td>', 'Told you!! I really do expect to see your 5D mkII on eBay!!! Keep this up and ''D'' in DP Challenge will stand for Dougi555. Well done Alan.', '2009-10-07 01:06:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677573, 824566, 86779, '<td valign="top">Great use of filters! Wonderful shot.</td>', 'Great use of filters! Wonderful shot.', '2009-10-07 01:08:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677574, 824664, 83313, '<td valign="top">As usual, I am the only one anal enough to see compression artifacts. Congrats on the HM.</td>', 'As usual, I am the only one anal enough to see compression artifacts. Congrats on the HM.', '2009-10-07 01:09:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677583, 824547, 80608, '<td valign="top">congrats Irene...<br/>You Go girl!</td>', 'congrats Irene...You Go girl!', '2009-10-07 01:12:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677595, 824066, 83313, '<td valign="top">I was pleased to see my in-challenge comment matching up with your own description. I like that, when I get comments that match my own perceptions of my shot.</td>', 'I was pleased to see my in-challenge comment matching up with your own description. I like that, when I get comments that match my own perceptions of my shot.', '2009-10-07 01:14:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677600, 824547, 31637, '<td valign="top">What a great shot, well lit and good for B/W...imagine how much better it could be if there was someone standing down the hall! congrats on another winner.</td>', 'What a great shot, well lit and good for B/W...imagine how much better it could be if there was someone standing down the hall! congrats on another winner.', '2009-10-07 01:15:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677605, 824566, 31637, '<td valign="top">Great mood present, like the processing too, congrats.</td>', 'Great mood present, like the processing too, congrats.', '2009-10-07 01:16:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677611, 824693, 83313, '<td valign="top">Whatcha doing down here?! Wasn''t my fault, it got a 6 from me. I thought the tree trunk and the lines of the hills and horizon were straight enough to count. Apparently, others didn''t think so.</td>', 'Whatcha doing down here?! Wasn''t my fault, it got a 6 from me. I thought the tree trunk and the lines of the hills and horizon were straight enough to count. Apparently, others didn''t think so.', '2009-10-07 01:18:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677620, 823837, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ouch. You certainly didn''t mean to add to your brown collection with this.</td>', 'Ouch. You certainly didn''t mean to add to your brown collection with this.', '2009-10-07 01:23:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677634, 824708, 108351, '<td valign="top">Nice to see there are a few Thelonious Monk fans here on DPC<br/></td>', 'Nice to see there are a few Thelonious Monk fans here on DPC', '2009-10-07 01:27:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677652, 823349, 68947, '<td valign="top">First entry ever in here and you get a ribbon!  wow!  Congrats!  <br/> <br/>Wonder if this is a record for DPC? :)</td>', 'First entry ever in here and you get a ribbon!  wow!  Congrats!   Wonder if this is a record for DPC? :)', '2009-10-07 01:38:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677654, 823349, 72103, '<td valign="top">Love it, nice catch</td>', 'Love it, nice catch', '2009-10-07 01:38:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677655, 824547, 72103, '<td valign="top">Yeah, loved the clean crisp lines in voting, love it now......   Great work!</td>', 'Yeah, loved the clean crisp lines in voting, love it now......   Great work!', '2009-10-07 01:39:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677667, 824566, 64446, '<td valign="top">Lovely image! The color nuances and the human presence make it really stand out here.<br/>Congrats on your well deserved blue!</td>', 'Lovely image! The color nuances and the human presence make it really stand out here.Congrats on your well deserved blue!', '2009-10-07 01:44:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677670, 823349, 64446, '<td valign="top">That''s a perspective! Very well done! Congratulations on your "red"!!</td>', 'That''s a perspective! Very well done! Congratulations on your "red"!!', '2009-10-07 01:46:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677671, 824566, 52549, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, moody image. Well done, Alan. Many congrats on your blue.</td>', 'Gorgeous, moody image. Well done, Alan. Many congrats on your blue.', '2009-10-07 01:46:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677673, 824547, 28742, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/28742/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_784795.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/28742/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_784795.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/28742/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_784795.gif"/></td>', '', '2009-10-07 01:47:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677677, 824547, 64446, '<td valign="top">Very captivating... Love it! Congratulations!</td>', 'Very captivating... Love it! Congratulations!', '2009-10-07 01:47:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677678, 823349, 52549, '<td valign="top">Huge congratulations on your ribbon Mergim. I love this image, glad it did well for you.</td>', 'Huge congratulations on your ribbon Mergim. I love this image, glad it did well for you.', '2009-10-07 01:48:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677682, 824566, 28742, '<td valign="top">Whoa Mr. Douglas! You are on a roll! Quite an accomplishment for a 2 yr old. :) GREAT image here - very well deserved - congratulations.</td>', 'Whoa Mr. Douglas! You are on a roll! Quite an accomplishment for a 2 yr old. :) GREAT image here - very well deserved - congratulations.', '2009-10-07 01:50:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677684, 823349, 28742, '<td valign="top">WOW - red on first challenge! Hope this is the beginning of something great. :) Congratulations.</td>', 'WOW - red on first challenge! Hope this is the beginning of something great. :) Congratulations.', '2009-10-07 01:50:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677689, 823327, 53814, '<td valign="top">super!</td>', 'super!', '2009-10-07 01:51:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677695, 823882, 64446, '<td valign="top">Very good eye! Congrats on such strong finish!!</td>', 'Very good eye! Congrats on such strong finish!!', '2009-10-07 01:53:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677699, 824566, 83600, '<td valign="top">Ur having a good week! Well done!<br/></td>', 'Ur having a good week! Well done!', '2009-10-07 01:56:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677700, 824547, 79955, '<td valign="top">Super Super shot !! Huge congrats again.  Aargh!! Now don''t go running away from me (in the DPC points race) , I have some nice shots lined up in the coming challenges.<br/> <br/>No seriously , you have been one of my main sources of motivation &amp; inspiration so keep those ribbons coming.</td>', 'Super Super shot !! Huge congrats again.  Aargh!! Now don''t go running away from me (in the DPC points race) , I have some nice shots lined up in the coming challenges. No seriously , you have been one of my main sources of motivation & inspiration so keep those ribbons coming.', '2009-10-07 01:57:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677703, 824566, 79955, '<td valign="top">Congrats again !!! for such a brilliant shot</td>', 'Congrats again !!! for such a brilliant shot', '2009-10-07 01:58:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677705, 823349, 79955, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the Red !!! fantastic perspective</td>', 'Congrats on the Red !!! fantastic perspective', '2009-10-07 01:59:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677708, 823938, 79955, '<td valign="top">Mr. Ang you are going great !!!!! Congrats on the Top 10 my friend.</td>', 'Mr. Ang you are going great !!!!! Congrats on the Top 10 my friend.', '2009-10-07 02:00:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677719, 824566, 109478, '<td valign="top">Contratulation!<br/>So good that you have 2 blue ribbons on the frontpage at the same time.</td>', 'Contratulation!So good that you have 2 blue ribbons on the frontpage at the same time.', '2009-10-07 02:06:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677721, 824547, 52549, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by RulerZigzag:</b></div><hr/><i> What a great shot, well lit and good for B/W...imagine how much better it could be if there was someone standing down the hall! congrats on another winner. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I so agree with you. The only problem was, there were either groups of people or the corridor was empty. In the car on the way home it occured to me I could have got my husband to stand at the end of the corridor... Could have kicked myself ;-)</td>', 'Originally posted by RulerZigzag: What a great shot, well lit and good for B/W...imagine how much better it could be if there was someone standing down the hall! congrats on another winner.  I so agree with you. The only problem was, there were either groups of people or the corridor was empty. In the car on the way home it occured to me I could have got my husband to stand at the end of the corridor... Could have kicked myself ;-)', '2009-10-07 02:06:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677728, 824628, 79955, '<td valign="top">Super Mr. Soon. Nice Top20 finish.</td>', 'Super Mr. Soon. Nice Top20 finish.', '2009-10-07 02:19:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677730, 824614, 79955, '<td valign="top">Super shot Barbara !! Can''t quite those two 1 votes. Crazy voters!!</td>', 'Super shot Barbara !! Can''t quite those two 1 votes. Crazy voters!!', '2009-10-07 02:21:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677742, 824566, 102534, '<td valign="top">congratulations, awesome perspective</td>', 'congratulations, awesome perspective', '2009-10-07 02:30:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677745, 824547, 102534, '<td valign="top">great shot, i can feel the open door and lines pulling me in :)</td>', 'great shot, i can feel the open door and lines pulling me in :)', '2009-10-07 02:32:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677775, 824302, 109478, '<td valign="top">Nice! I give blue ribbon to this photo.</td>', 'Nice! I give blue ribbon to this photo.', '2009-10-07 03:11:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677786, 823938, 100727, '<td valign="top"><b>Post Challenge</b> <br/> <br/>Andrew, you''re too kind with your words.<br/> <br/>Dustin Gooding, no star filter was used.<br/> <br/>Benjamin, I didn''t do anything.  The torches are underground, shining upwards.<br/> <br/>Chuck A, thanks for your input.  I appreciate it.<br/> <br/><i>Oh, I thought the above response in the Photographer''s Comment.  How do I do that?</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-10-07 02:29:23.</i></td>', 'Post Challenge  Andrew, you''re too kind with your words. Dustin Gooding, no star filter was used. Benjamin, I didn''t do anything.  The torches are underground, shining upwards. Chuck A, thanks for your input.  I appreciate it. Oh, I thought the above response in the Photographer''s Comment.  How do I do that?', '2009-10-07 03:26:23.000000', '2009-10-07 03:29:23.000000', 0),
(5677796, 824480, 100727, '<td valign="top">Hello Andrew, this is a lovely photo.  This image is totally different than the usual ones submitted by you.  Good job.</td>', 'Hello Andrew, this is a lovely photo.  This image is totally different than the usual ones submitted by you.  Good job.', '2009-10-07 03:32:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677807, 824566, 66616, '<td valign="top">well done</td>', 'well done', '2009-10-07 03:38:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677810, 824547, 104650, '<td valign="top">Hey, also a B/W shot in third place here :) Congratulations on the ribbon!</td>', 'Hey, also a B/W shot in third place here :) Congratulations on the ribbon!', '2009-10-07 03:41:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677828, 824547, 56797, '<td valign="top">You have the magic touch my dear! Congrats!</td>', 'You have the magic touch my dear! Congrats!', '2009-10-07 04:05:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677841, 824693, 39427, '<td valign="top">lol, ouch, haven''t had a 4 in a while... i mean, the tree is straight and it''s the focal point but I guess i missed this one</td>', 'lol, ouch, haven''t had a 4 in a while... i mean, the tree is straight and it''s the focal point but I guess i missed this one', '2009-10-07 04:11:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677868, 824612, 108580, '<td valign="top">Simply stunning and heady. Congrats, sorry it didnt ribbon, my only 10.</td>', 'Simply stunning and heady. Congrats, sorry it didnt ribbon, my only 10.', '2009-10-07 05:02:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677869, 823534, 108580, '<td valign="top">I loved this, made me wonder who (or what) I''m sharing the cage with! Would have liked to see what it was I''m being fed...8</td>', 'I loved this, made me wonder who (or what) I''m sharing the cage with! Would have liked to see what it was I''m being fed...8', '2009-10-07 05:04:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677870, 824547, 82707, '<td valign="top">Congrats!  Good eye, processed to perfection... and in basic.....WTG!</td>', 'Congrats!  Good eye, processed to perfection... and in basic.....WTG!', '2009-10-07 05:05:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677871, 824547, 38509, '<td valign="top">oh! it''s not a macro with a milk ?!? :-)))<br/> <br/>congratz. i love this kind od photos</td>', 'oh! it''s not a macro with a milk ?!? :-))) congratz. i love this kind od photos', '2009-10-07 05:06:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677872, 824566, 82707, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue!  Super image!  Great tones and colours!</td>', 'Congrats on the blue!  Super image!  Great tones and colours!', '2009-10-07 05:07:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677874, 824547, 27133, '<td valign="top">Hey congrats girl...looks like an awesome place.</td>', 'Hey congrats girl...looks like an awesome place.', '2009-10-07 05:08:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677875, 824547, 41142, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Irene! I''m glad to see you doing so well with something different than a kitchen or abstract macro! ;-) Well done!</td>', 'Congratulations, Irene! I''m glad to see you doing so well with something different than a kitchen or abstract macro! ;-) Well done!', '2009-10-07 05:09:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677876, 824288, 108580, '<td valign="top">I looked at this from out of the box. If you look from end to end DOWN a curved line of architecture it is still straight on one axis. I appreciated this shot as not one of the norm and it got a 9 for ingenuity, composure and a sense of humour/risk from the photog. WD</td>', 'I looked at this from out of the box. If you look from end to end DOWN a curved line of architecture it is still straight on one axis. I appreciated this shot as not one of the norm and it got a 9 for ingenuity, composure and a sense of humour/risk from the photog. WD', '2009-10-07 05:11:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677878, 824480, 82707, '<td valign="top">Good concept, and nicely executed....... and good luck with your next submission, you can''t let the girls beat you. :)</td>', 'Good concept, and nicely executed....... and good luck with your next submission, you can''t let the girls beat you. :)', '2009-10-07 05:11:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677896, 823349, 82707, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your Ribbon, and first challenge!  It meets the challenge perfectly!</td>', 'Congrats on your Ribbon, and first challenge!  It meets the challenge perfectly!', '2009-10-07 05:24:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5677905, 824547, 52549, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by fmalan:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations, Irene! I''m glad to see you doing so well with something different than a kitchen or abstract macro! ;-) Well done! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>LOL! Couldn''t take the kitchen with me, so I had to do something else ;-))</td>', 'Originally posted by fmalan: Congratulations, Irene! I''m glad to see you doing so well with something different than a kitchen or abstract macro! ;-) Well done!  LOL! Couldn''t take the kitchen with me, so I had to do something else ;-))', '2009-10-07 05:29:46.000000', NULL, 0);
