(5677947, 824547, 82749, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by IreneM:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by fmalan:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations, Irene! I''m glad to see you doing so well with something different than a kitchen or abstract macro! ;-) Well done! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>LOL! Couldn''t take the kitchen with me, so I had to do something else ;-)) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Knowing you, after an attempt at breaking into the hotel kitchen failed you were forced to settle for this.  :-)</td>', 'Originally posted by IreneM: Originally posted by fmalan: Congratulations, Irene! I''m glad to see you doing so well with something different than a kitchen or abstract macro! ;-) Well done!  LOL! Couldn''t take the kitchen with me, so I had to do something else ;-))  Knowing you, after an attempt at breaking into the hotel kitchen failed you were forced to settle for this.  :-)', '2009-10-07 06:37:31.000000', NULL, 0),
