(5678764, 823837, 83544, '<td valign="top">well as it is said in the comments, the photo is washed out so you need too spent more time on editing, a highter contrast would have done the job (use Gimp if you cannot afford photoshop...it''s free) or try diferent exposures while shooting (considering the type of camera you have, this photo should probably look astonishing if it''s taken with the proper exposure and aperture) another thing is that it really doesn''t fit the contest, and another subjective matter is not all people want to see graveyards, try shooting something more happier. I didn''t have time to vote on all the photos, but if I did I''d give it 3 or 4 just because it has a low contrast not taking the other things mention above. Hope I was helpful</td>', 'well as it is said in the comments, the photo is washed out so you need too spent more time on editing, a highter contrast would have done the job (use Gimp if you cannot afford photoshop...it''s free) or try diferent exposures while shooting (considering the type of camera you have, this photo should probably look astonishing if it''s taken with the proper exposure and aperture) another thing is that it really doesn''t fit the contest, and another subjective matter is not all people want to see graveyards, try shooting something more happier. I didn''t have time to vote on all the photos, but if I did I''d give it 3 or 4 just because it has a low contrast not taking the other things mention above. Hope I was helpful', '2009-10-07 16:24:32.000000', NULL, 0),
